      "after00000000000": {
        "_id": "after00000000000",
        "type": "base",
        "description": "<p>If any target becomes [[/apply stitched]] to the other, both targets are stitched together. While stitched together, a target takes a bane on power rolls while not adjacent to a creature they’re stitched to.</p><p>Whenever a stitched target takes damage that wasn’t dealt by or also taken by another stitched target, each other stitched target takes half the damage the initial target took.</p><p><strong>Strained</strong>: You target yourself and three enemies instead.</p>",
